Create Your Own Website

Right now you see default Apache page.

👉 Let’s change it.

🧠 Think:

Where does Apache store website files?

(Hint: starts with /var/)

👉 Try to guess the path first.

💡 After you guess, do this:
cd /var/www/html

Create a file:

sudo nano index.html

Add:

<h1>Hello from Akash Cloud Server 🚀</h1>

Save → refresh browser
